# EXPECT-SUBSTRING: khong phai ket qua cua iter
# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
# `next(x)` voi `x` khong phai ket qua cua `iter()` phai bi tu choi, KHONG
# duoc im lang gia tri 0 hay ban - do la loai sai am thanh nguy hiem nhat
# (ket qua dung, chi lech o vi tri, khong test nao bat duoc).
def run() -> "i32":
    x = 5
    y = next(x)
    print("should_not_build")
    return y